# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Downloaded ONNX model weights
#
# The tiny generated models under tests/EasyImageSharp.AI.Tests/Models/ ARE committed (all under 1 KB,
# and the AI tests must run offline). Real model weights are fetched at run time into the user's cache
# and must never enter the repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
models/
!tests/EasyImageSharp.AI.Tests/Models/
*.onnx.data

